sequenceDiagram
    participant 10 as First
    participant 2 as Second
    participant T as Observer
    10->2: Plain line
    2-->10: Dashed line
    loop Work
        Note over 10,2: In outer loop
        10->>2: Request
        opt Nested work
            Note right of 2: In nested block
            2->>2: Inspect
        end
        2-->>10: Response
    end
    loop Annotation only
        Note over 10,2: Note without a message
    end
    2->>T: Notify observer
